  "decision_agency": "Borough",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would result in a poor standard of accommodation for future occupiers, due to poor outlook from the habitable rooms and the inappropriate layout and design of the accommodations, as well as the excessive noise from commercial uses adjacent; therefore would not be permitted as would not comply with the conditions MA.2. (2)(d), (f) and (i), Part 3, Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal fails to provide adequate provision of access to cycle parking and insufficient information on waste and recycling facilities. Therefore transport impacts of the development are not adequately addressed. The proposal would therefore be contrary to the terms of Schedule 2, Part 3, Class MA, Paragraph MA.2 (2)(a) of the Town and County Planning (General Permitted Development)(England) Order (2015)(as amended)."
  ],
